#SKIPTEST
#chip 18F4550, 20

'Change1657 test: #option bootloaderhost Rule 3 - #option bootloader and #option bootloaderhost
'cannot both be used in the same program (one builds the application, the other the host).
'Expect: Error "use either #option bootloader (an application) or #option bootloaderhost
'(a bootloader)"

#option bootloader 0xA000
#option bootloaderhost 0xA000

Do
Loop
